WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.038 --> 00:00:08.079
"Destroying Meltron sounds hard!" Roxy said. "Where is he?"

2
00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:14.456
"Here," Dr. Odd said. "He's deep below the surface, at Groon's core."

3
00:00:14.457 --> 00:00:16.697
He typed on a computer.

4
00:00:16.698 --> 00:00:19.755
A hologram of Groon appeared.

5
00:00:19.756 --> 00:00:24.490
It showed what Groon was like now, covered in machinery and metal.

6
00:00:24.491 --> 00:00:27.812
Just then Roxy heard a cup shatter on the floor.

7
00:00:27.813 --> 00:00:33.392
Dr. Odd's tea spilled everywhere.

8
00:00:33.393 --> 00:00:37.218
"Oops, me," a tiny robot said.

9
00:00:37.219 --> 00:00:39.969
It was round with big eyes.

10
00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:44.441
Dr. Odd groaned. "Be careful, Bippo!"

11
00:00:44.442 --> 00:00:48.928
The robot looked down. "Sorry, me."

12
00:00:48.929 --> 00:00:53.103
"Aw!" Roxy said. "He's cute!"

13
00:00:53.104 --> 00:00:56.582
Bippo hurried over to Roxy.

14
00:00:56.583 --> 00:01:02.280
"Friend, you!" He jumped onto Roxy's shoulder.

15
00:01:02.281 --> 00:01:09.260
"Anyway," Dr. Odd said, "I have been doing deep scans of Groon since I arrived."

16
00:01:09.261 --> 00:01:13.615
Bippo pointed at Dr. Odd. "Busy, him!"

17
00:01:13.616 --> 00:01:17.251
Roxy giggled.

18
00:01:17.252 --> 00:01:25.475
Dr. Odd rolled his eyes. "Groon is covered in multiple layers of metal and machinery.

19
00:01:25.476 --> 00:01:32.172
These layers have a network of tunnels and rooms that Meltron's robots use to move around."

20
00:01:32.173 --> 00:01:37.243
Dr. Odd waved his hand to make the hologram zoom in.

21
00:01:37.244 --> 00:01:42.210
"My scanners can't reach the center of the planet," Dr. Odd said.

22
00:01:42.211 --> 00:01:45.082
"But I'm sure Meltron is down there.

23
00:01:45.083 --> 00:01:48.798
Strong signals are coming from Groon's core.

24
00:01:48.799 --> 00:01:55.114
The signals seem to control all the other robots. It must be him."

25
00:01:55.115 --> 00:01:58.376
He waved his hand again, and the hologram zoomed out.

26
00:01:58.377 --> 00:02:03.513
Roxy and Cozlin saw a glowing layer just below the surface.

27
00:02:03.514 --> 00:02:07.132
"That's the energy shield!" Cozlin said.

28
00:02:07.133 --> 00:02:10.857
"You know about that?" Dr. Odd asked.

29
00:02:10.858 --> 00:02:15.612
Roxy nodded. "It took away our super powers."

30
00:02:15.613 --> 00:02:22.185
"That energy shield disrupts any technology that's not from Meltron," Dr. Odd said.

31
00:02:22.186 --> 00:02:25.264
"It's part of Meltron's defense system.

32
00:02:25.265 --> 00:02:30.787
Because of it, I can't pilot my big robot inside the planet."

33
00:02:30.788 --> 00:02:39.579
He sighed. "I didn't realize the energy shield worked on super powers too.

34
00:02:39.580 --> 00:02:44.136
We'll need to disable it."

35
00:02:44.137 --> 00:02:47.421
He zoomed in on a computer.

36
00:02:47.422 --> 00:02:52.226
"That's the computer that controls the energy shield," Dr. Odd said.

37
00:02:52.227 --> 00:02:56.549
"If I can get to it, I can turn off the energy shield.

38
00:02:56.550 --> 00:03:00.308
Then you two won't lose your powers again."

39
00:03:00.309 --> 00:03:06.639
"That sounds like a good plan," Cozlin said, "but Meltron has a lot of robots.

40
00:03:06.640 --> 00:03:13.492
I hate to admit it, but we can't fight them all and fight Meltron too!"

41
00:03:13.493 --> 00:03:20.788
Roxy bit her lip. "Kid Comet is right. The robots are kind of easy to fight, but—"

42
00:03:20.789 --> 00:03:24.039
"Strong, you," Bippo said.

43
00:03:24.040 --> 00:03:26.858
"Thanks, Bippo," Roxy said.

44
00:03:26.859 --> 00:03:29.210
"But there are way too many of them.

45
00:03:29.211 --> 00:03:33.075
It could be hard to get past them to reach Meltron."

46
00:03:33.076 --> 00:03:43.690
Dr. Odd tapped his chin. "Then we'll have to disable Meltron's controller as well."

47
00:03:43.691 --> 00:03:47.870
"We don't know where that is, do we?" Roxy asked.

48
00:03:47.871 --> 00:03:53.234
Dr. Odd rolled his eyes. "Did you forget, Rocket Girl?

49
00:03:53.235 --> 00:04:00.013
I'm Earth's leading expert on robot technology. I know where the controller is."

50
00:04:00.014 --> 00:04:03.414
"Smart, him," Bippo said.

51
00:04:03.415 --> 00:04:06.319
"Where is it?" Cozlin asked.

52
00:04:06.320 --> 00:04:13.857
Dr. Odd gave a nervous laugh. "Inside Meltron."

53
00:04:13.858 --> 00:04:20.539
"Are you kidding?" Cozlin said. "How will we get inside Meltron?"

54
00:04:20.540 --> 00:04:28.059
Dr. Odd shrugged. "I don't know."

55
00:04:28.060 --> 00:04:33.580
"Oh!" Roxy said. "I know someone who can make himself tiny!"

56
00:04:33.581 --> 00:04:38.523
Then she sighed. "Never mind."

57
00:04:38.524 --> 00:04:42.365
Cozlin scratched her head. "Why?"

58
00:04:42.366 --> 00:04:54.240
"We have no way to find him," Roxy said. "He's in another world!"

